C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ngosa7gVH134bQfXR5JboQ","review_id":"n-M5V9ci2XDGjY63EoWfnw","date":"2013-11-18T21:41:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9431156516075134,"text_excerpt":"Confession. I worked at Morton's for about a year and a half fresh out of college. I was a hostess and loved every minute of it....but they aren't my favorite steakhouse in the City. However- they do have the best happy hour deals. My girlfriend and I went after work last week and enjoyed the great Happy Hour Menu. In addition to $8 glasses of wine and coctails, there's also a variety of other items that you can order for the same price during Happy Hours of 4-6p. The truffled french fries are like (what I assume) CRACK (to be). I couldn't stop eating them! I also had the crabcake sliders and the filet minon sliders. Yummy! The restaurant has been newly renovated with a much open welcomin..."},{"business_id":"ngosa7gVH134bQfXR5JboQ","review_id":"cFdYbekQ6nRf89bztwXJLw","date":"2013-02-17T03:07:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9316824078559875,"text_excerpt":"We went to Morton's yesterday to have drinks at the bar and watch the Celebrity All Star Game. The bar is a little tight, there are a few tables and maybe 8-10 chairs at the bar itself, but the TVs are a good size and there were three bartenders working on a busy Friday. Though there was a drink menu offered, they had a second drink menu that was still in the works, so they let us choose from both. The bar was extremely well stocked, so you could really order just about anything. We also ordered the Parmesan truffle fries (YUM), the mini crab cake BLTs, and the beef tenderloin tacos. The crab cakes were tasty, but the buns were a little too big (or the cakes were a little too small). The ..."},{"business_id":"ngosa7gVH134bQfXR5JboQ","review_id":"KLhXHmkGed3URP812ZBMqA","date":"2010-12-31T20:04:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9298020005226135,"text_excerpt":"While we didn't have dinner there (I am a vegetarian after all) the bar at Morton's was amazing. Super tiny and on the second floor (accessible only by elevator), it was like drinking with 20 of your closest friends. Especially great was the bartender, Polo, who was really friendly and served up some nice drinks. I would def check out the bar bites specials ($6-11 for appetizers and $5 for drinks) that they run from 9:30-closing during the week, as all the food around us looked mighty delicious, which can be enjoyed without the steakhouse sticker shock."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ngosa7gVH134bQfXR5JboQ","photo_id":"mYMhaHme0CbilWUNPa271w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/mYMhaHme0CbilWUNPa271w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8754547834396362},{"business_id":"ngosa7gVH134bQfXR5JboQ","photo_id":"t6gtESn4E9y9JtaCQ6fPjA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/t6gtESn4E9y9JtaCQ6fPjA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.873074471950531},{"business_id":"ngosa7gVH134bQfXR5JboQ","photo_id":"iZBH99Ek2Z-IlGrOXb_iig","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iZBH99Ek2Z-IlGrOXb_iig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8722905516624451},{"business_id":"ngosa7gVH134bQfXR5JboQ","photo_id":"Ph6Iv0LlWf51vjRg-1HOXg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Ph6Iv0LlWf51vjRg-1HOXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7970521450042725},{"business_id":"ngosa7gVH134bQfXR5JboQ","photo_id":"K33l-HGq3LOJ4a5y69bwhA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/K33l-HGq3LOJ4a5y69bwhA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7948286533355713}]},"notebook_case":null}
